orption. Monitor for signs of worsening anemia or complications such as heart failure. Follow-up: Reassess in 4-6 weeks with repeat hemoglobin, ferritin, and TIBC. If symptoms persist or worsen, consider referral to a gastroenterologist for further evaluation."
